    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract termination",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The guidance documents are intended to provide technical guidance and help with interpretation and understanding of the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract termination",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The guidance documents should be read in conjunction with the Procurement Act 2023 and its associated regulations and are aimed at procurement practitioners and commercial policy leads in contracting authorities. They are intended to provide technical guidance and help with interpretation and understanding of the Procurement Act 2023.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract termination",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Procurement Act 2023 (Act) gives contracting authorities the benefit of an implied term in every public contract that ensures that the contract can be terminated by the contracting authority in three specific circumstances, referred to as ‘termination grounds’ in the Act. For",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract termination",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "All contracting authorities must publish a ‘contract termination notice’ following the termination of any public contract (with the exception of contracts awarded by private utilities and contracts for ‘user choice services’ that have been directly awarded under Schedule 5, paragraph 15).",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract termination",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
